[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4145.669, "timestamp": "01:09:05", "text": "私は死にかけている。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4147.91, "timestamp": "01:09:07", "text": "最近、日が長くなったように感じる。 そういえば"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4149.829, "timestamp": "01:09:09", "text": "、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4153.99, "timestamp": "01:09:13", "text": "もうすぐ夏時間が始まるんだね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4165.669, "timestamp": "01:09:25", "text": "[うめき声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4167.43, "timestamp": "01:09:27", "text": "ああ、私は死んだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4176.789, "timestamp": "01:09:36", "text": "今はあまり調子が良くないんです。 私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4178.709, "timestamp": "01:09:38", "text": "ショーを披露する準備ができています。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4181.99, "timestamp": "01:09:41", "text": "裁判官、陪審員、死刑執行人。"}]